post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'

Meridian is installed, but this package does not install or enable a systemd
service. Start Meridian manually with `meridian`, or manage your own user unit
if you want it to run in the background.

For OpenCode, add the provider endpoint and Meridian OpenCode plugin to
~/.config/opencode/opencode.json. Minimal snippet:

{
  "provider": {
    "anthropic": {
      "options": {
        "apiKey": "x",
        "baseURL": "http://127.0.0.1:3456"
      }
    }
  },
  "plugin": [
    "/usr/lib/meridian/plugin/meridian.ts"
  ]
}

Convenience command to merge that into an existing OpenCode config:

mkdir -p "$HOME/.config/opencode"
test -f "$HOME/.config/opencode/opencode.json" || printf '{}\n' > "$HOME/.config/opencode/opencode.json"
tmp=$(mktemp)
jq '
  .provider.anthropic.options.apiKey = (.provider.anthropic.options.apiKey // "x") |
  .provider.anthropic.options.baseURL = "http://127.0.0.1:3456" |
  .plugin = (((.plugin // []) | map(select(. != "/usr/lib/meridian/plugin/meridian.ts"))) + ["/usr/lib/meridian/plugin/meridian.ts"])
' "$HOME/.config/opencode/opencode.json" > "$tmp" && mv "$tmp" "$HOME/.config/opencode/opencode.json"

Recommended for OpenCode: install meridian-plugin-opencode-scrub-git, then
enable the compiled plugin in ~/.config/meridian/plugins.json:

mkdir -p "$HOME/.config/meridian"
test -f "$HOME/.config/meridian/plugins.json" || printf '{"plugins":[]}\n' > "$HOME/.config/meridian/plugins.json"
tmp=$(mktemp)
jq '
  .plugins = (((.plugins // []) | map(select(.path != "/usr/lib/meridian/node_modules/@rynfar/meridian-plugin-opencode-scrub/dist/index.js"))) + [{"path":"/usr/lib/meridian/node_modules/@rynfar/meridian-plugin-opencode-scrub/dist/index.js","enabled":true}])
' "$HOME/.config/meridian/plugins.json" > "$tmp" && mv "$tmp" "$HOME/.config/meridian/plugins.json"

After changing OpenCode config, restart OpenCode. If Meridian is already
running, reload Meridian plugins with:

curl -fsS -X POST http://127.0.0.1:3456/plugins/reload

EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
